  "description": "TIYKAQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C104 H84 N12 O22 Tb4. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.593-3.862 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.75-111.55°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C104H84N12O22Tb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
